{'symbol': 'MSFT', 'date': '2022-10-13 02:50:00', 'title': 'E& AND SES JOIN FORCES TO OFFER ONE-HOP CONNECTIVITY TO MICROSOFT AZURE', 'text': 'LUXEMBOURG & DUBAI, UNITED ARAB EMIRATES--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE CARRIER AND WHOLESALE SERVICES (C&WS) DIVISION OF E& (FORMERLY KNOWN AS ETISALAT GROUP) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS PARTNERSHIP WITH MICROSOFT AND SES TO HOST THE CO-LOCATED SES O3B MPOWER AND MICROSOFT GROUND STATION AT RAS AL KHAIMAH.'}